WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.690
Hi, I'm Max. I'm the Builder.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.538
I help you build your own plugin, step by step.

00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:12.610
We name it, say who it's for, and add your own lessons.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:21.210
For example, tell me your best lesson, and I'll help you turn it into a plugin other teachers can use.

